MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3183906234995449697}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9e7250556d00d84840dc85e6ae57d36d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_name: 
  m_priceToActivate: 0
  m_isSingleUse: 0
  m_isContinuesActivation: 0
  m_isCanBeUsedToActivate: 1
  m_isCanBeTouchedToActivate: 0
  m_isCanBeShotToActivate: 0
  m_isCanBeActivatedByNPC: 0
  m_isShowOutline: 0
  m_isHideNotificationInteract: 0
  m_isObstructionPaths: 0
  m_isUnInteractable: 0
  m_objectsToEnableAfterActivation: []
  m_objectsToDisableAfterActivation: []
  m_spawnersToEnableAfterActivation: []
  m_interactablesToActivateAfterActivation: []
  m_text: 'Dear Subject,


    Well done! You have completed all the experiments
    that we asked you to do. Our associates will be pleased to receive all the data
    you have provided to us. The videotapes we have made of your expeditions are
    analyzed (and enjoyed) and very appreciated.


    Thank you for your cooperation.
    You have turned out to be the most valuable subject we ever had. The amount of
    succes you seem to have with experimenting is surprising. Out of all the subjects
    we have put to the test, you are definetely the most motivated (and depraved)
    of all. We will miss watching you.


    As promised, here is the code for the
    keypad to open the door:

    $


    Before you leave, please consider staying
    with us. We can''t get enough of the data you provide, and the... way you react
    to hostile entities. We will provide you with food and water for the rest of
    your life, among other things.


    We highly recommend you to stay here, your
    new home. If you decide to leave, however, go ahead. But let us make ourselves
    very clear: We are very discreet about our organization and our operations. We
    will make sure you won''t be able to share what you have learned about us to
    the rest of the world.


    - SIT'
